<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to appear in parliament on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to appear in parliament on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will appear before the finance committee of parliament's Lower House throughout Wednesday, the BOJ said in a statement.</p>
<p>Matsushita will be answering questions from six legislators at the committee meeting scheduled to start at 9.20 a.m. (020 GMT), the BOJ said.</p>
